  "annotations": [
    {
      "id": "row-dashboard",
      "x": 0,
      "y": -240,
      "w": 760,
      "text": "THE DASHBOARD \u2014 spec \u00a75\nTime is the primary axis, life areas filter it. Today groups by priority rather than by hour, because most commitments have a date but no time. Undated things stay in the Inbox and out of your way."
    },
    {
      "id": "row-capture",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 920,
      "w": 760,
      "text": "CAPTURE \u2014 spec \u00a76 and \u00a77\nHold to speak. The transcript comes back before anything is interpreted, so a wrong result tells you immediately whether it misheard you or misread you. The note is kept either way \u2014 even when there's no task in it. Capture also works with no signal."
    },
    {
      "id": "row-recall",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 2080,
      "w": 760,
      "text": "ASK & RECALL \u2014 spec \u00a78\nTwo different questions, two different engines. \"What's on Thursday\" is counted from the database, never guessed by a model. \"What did I say about the budget\" comes from your own notes, and always shows which ones."
    },
    {
      "id": "row-proactive",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 3240,
      "w": 760,
      "text": "PROACTIVE & SAFE \u2014 spec \u00a711 and \u00a713\nAnything other people would see waits for a yes. Anything reversible just happens, and appears here with an undo. The weekly review is the one screen that argues for work you never asked about."
    }
  ],
  "launch": {
    "view": "canvas"
  }
